        "title": "Sozzi: Anthropic’s IPO Surges; Is AMD’s Pullback a Buy?",
        "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance Executive Editor Brian Sozzi breaks down the biggest stories to kick off the trading day, including the performance of Anthropic (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ANT/\" data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\">ANT</a>)’s IPO, whether AMD (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD/\" data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\">AMD</a>)’s pullback presents a buying opportunity, and Gap (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GAP/\" data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\">GAP</a>)’s fall earnings warning.</p>\n<p>Sozzi then sits down with former Bridgewater (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BWB/\" data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\">BWB</a>) Associates Chief Investment Strategist Rebecca Patterson and former BNY (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BNY/\" data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\">BNY</a>) Wealth Management CEO Catherine Keating to discuss their new book, <em>Investment Wisdom</em>, and how its lessons can help friends and loved ones navigate investing.</p>",
